.\" Manual page for BabaChain staking
.TH BABACHAIN-STAKING "1" "November 2025" "babachain-staking v1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
babachain-staking \- BabaChain Proof-of-Stake staking guide
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B babachaind
[\fI\,staking options\/\fR]
.br
.B babachain-qt
[\fI\,staking options\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
BabaChain uses Proof-of-Stake (PoS) consensus, allowing users to earn rewards by staking their coins. This manual page describes how to set up and optimize staking operations.
.SH STAKING OVERVIEW
Staking is the process of holding BabaChain coins in your wallet to support network operations and earn rewards. Unlike traditional Proof-of-Work mining, staking:
.IP \(bu 2
Requires no expensive hardware
.IP \(bu 2
Uses minimal electricity
.IP \(bu 2
Can be done with any amount of BabaChain
.IP \(bu 2
Provides consistent daily rewards (~1% daily)
.SH STAKING REQUIREMENTS
.TP
.B Minimum Stake
Any amount (even 1 BabaChain works!)
.TP
.B Coin Maturity
8 hours after receiving coins
.TP
.B Wallet Status
Online and unlocked for staking
.TP
.B Internet Connection
Stable connection to BabaChain network
.SH STAKING OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-staking\fR
Enable staking (default: 1 if wallet is loaded)
.TP
\fB\-stakeminconfirmations=\fR<n>
Minimum confirmations required for staking (default: 1)
.TP
\fB\-stakeminage=\fR<n>
Minimum age in seconds for coins to be eligible for staking (default: 28800 = 8 hours)
.TP
\fB\-stakemaxage=\fR<n>
Maximum age in seconds for stake selection (default: -1 = no limit)
.TP
\fB\-stakecombinethreshold=\fR<amt>
Threshold for combining stakes (default: 1000)
.TP
\fB\-stakesplitthreshold=\fR<amt>
Threshold for splitting stakes (default: 2000)
.SH REWARD SYSTEM
.SS Base Rewards
.IP \(bu 2
Daily Rate: ~1% of your stake per day
.IP \(bu 2
Annual ROI: ~365% (before compounding)
.IP \(bu 2
Payment: Direct to your wallet address
.IP \(bu 2
Frequency: Every time you find a block
.SS Gradual Bonus System
BabaChain features a smooth bonus progression based on stake size:
.TP
.B 1-10,000 BabaChain
0-5% bonus (gradual increase)
.TP
.B 10,000-100,000 BabaChain
5-20% bonus (gradual increase)
.TP
.B 100,000+ BabaChain
Maximum 20% bonus
.SH STAKING SETUP
.SS Desktop Wallet
.IP 1. 3
Download and install BabaChain wallet
.IP 2. 3
Sync with the blockchain
.IP 3. 3
Transfer BabaChain to your wallet
.IP 4. 3
Wait 8 hours for coins to mature
.IP 5. 3
Enable staking in wallet settings
.IP 6. 3
Keep wallet online 24/7
.SS Command Line
.IP 1. 3
Start babachaind with staking enabled:
.br
.B babachaind -staking=1
.IP 2. 3
Unlock wallet for staking:
.br
.B babachain-cli walletpassphrase "password" 0 true
.IP 3. 3
Check staking status:
.br
.B babachain-cli getstakinginfo
.SH RPC COMMANDS
.TP
.B getstakinginfo
Get staking information and statistics
.TP
.B stakecoin <amount> [address]
Stake a specific amount of coins
.TP
.B listvalidators
List active validators on the network
.TP
.B getvalidatorinfo [validator_id]
Get information about a specific validator
.TP
.B setstakesplitthreshold <amount>
Set the threshold for automatic stake splitting
.SH OPTIMIZATION TIPS
.SS Maximize Rewards
.IP \(bu 2
Maintain high uptime (keep wallet online 24/7)
.IP \(bu 2
Use reliable internet connection
.IP \(bu 2
Consider dedicated staking device
.IP \(bu 2
Compound earnings by reinvesting rewards
.SS Security Best Practices
.IP \(bu 2
Use strong wallet passwords
.IP \(bu 2
Regular wallet backups
.IP \(bu 2
Keep software updated
.IP \(bu 2
Monitor staking performance
.SH TROUBLESHOOTING
.SS Staking Not Working
.IP \(bu 2
Check wallet is unlocked for staking
.IP \(bu 2
Verify coins have matured (8+ hours)
.IP \(bu 2
Ensure stable internet connection
.IP \(bu 2
Update to latest wallet version
.SS Low Rewards
.IP \(bu 2
Increase wallet uptime
.IP \(bu 2
Check network weight vs your stake
.IP \(bu 2
Verify staking is actually enabled
.IP \(bu 2
Consider increasing stake size
.SH EXAMPLES
.SS Basic Staking Setup
.nf
# Start daemon with staking enabled
babachaind -staking=1 -daemon

# Unlock wallet for staking only
babachain-cli walletpassphrase "mypassword" 0 true

# Check staking status
babachain-cli getstakinginfo

# View current validators
babachain-cli listvalidators
.fi
